{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <i>Chill Fishing \u2013 Relax, Catch, Upgrade!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the soothing depths of <i>Chill Fishing</i>, a minimalist fishing game where every cast is a new adventure. Cast your hook, explore the ocean depths, catch colorful fish, and discover rare and legendary species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear, unlock new biomes, and push your exploration further. Whether you have 5 minutes or hours to spare, <i>Chill Fishing</i> is the perfect experience to relax while feeling the thrill of the perfect catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Simple, relaxing gameplay accessible to everyone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc1f Collect dozens of unique fish, from common to rare species</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Upgrade your hook to catch more fish and reach new depths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Unlock diverse biomes, each with unique marine life</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb0 A smooth economy to progress at your own pace, stress-free</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play, relax\u2026 and let the sea surprise you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting Your Feet Wet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3473870/f4b002f8e3d8836969280ad76388fea6d677c973.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Diver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3473870/a6193f460c0ffe0059164c0cf8cdca7f0ca2cfbb.jpg"},{"name":"Hooked on Fishing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3473870/ea4dc0f891ec00dd361e4a65d4ccd0c13209f36f.jpg"},{"name":"Time Stops for No One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3473870/b9dc1ed2c73d569c278ba792f41149b678eafe27.jpg"},{"name":"Eternal Angler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco